It's just around the corner and [Camp Afro Foli](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/) tickets have been released! Grab your [Early Bird Tickets](/product/camp-afro-foli-full-camp/) now. You have until April 15th! We have Bassidi Kone from Mali, Clair Okamoto from Japan, Kwame Tosuma from Ghana and more to be announced!

There will be dancing on the beach, Friday night adventure night (more to be released soon) and of course Saturday evening performance and dinners. Back to back workshops for an entire weekend...and you may have to take the Friday off work to get the whole deal ;).

Located conveniently on the Sunshine Coast at the Sunshine Coast Recreation Centre. Awesome dance floor (yes this is important ;) and of course full catering and accommodation is included. Don't miss out on three days of drumming and dancing with international artists from all around the world.

You can read more about Camp Afro Foli [here](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/). In the meantime have a peek at these unreleased images to see what we got up to last year and [watch us in action!](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NNmTMrm8y5s&feature=youtu.be)

